    "Left hand + wristwatch + small ornate object (ring/brooch) | left hand holding object at center, watch on left wrist face outward, object in front of shirt | left hand still holding object, fingers repositioning it | object stays in foreground, correctly occludes shirt behind it; fingers correctly occlude object as they manipulate it",
    "Foreground surface (dark table edge) | barely visible at bottom edge, occluded by hands/arms | slightly more visible as hands lower | reveal is consistent with hands moving, and hands/arms correctly occlude the surface behind them throughout"
